   "text": "{\"explanations\":[{\"signal_id\":\"130792d5-80b3-4ab3-9bda-c56dd80654f6\",\"explanation\":\"Unrestricted cash headroom has narrowed each month, from {{fact:735d4528-2bc3-4245-ae80-f5fe5ee72941}} to {{fact:47642701-27fe-490a-928f-b33adde90f1c}} and then sharply to {{fact:370f7427-3266-4da7-b8ed-3e2ef5795114}}. Cash of {{fact:c71186d0-4532-4650-b75d-ba279b3f1fd5}} against a {{fact:587ac04d-68ab-41c8-acab-61e61e84577d}} floor is the tightest cushion of the three. The same cash decline is likely driving the falling runway signal.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"a80b2b77-718c-475e-a555-d4797a10915d\",\"explanation\":\"Runway headroom fell from {{fact:5923156d-5b17-4795-b08d-aaba65784c4f}} to {{fact:2be480c2-276a-4efa-87fa-e64211c8e831}}, with the steepest drop in October. Runway of {{fact:5c962657-cdc9-4c76-86e7-d5549a472a92}} months is still well above the {{fact:5924794a-483f-4ff7-a304-12c5266711bc}}-month minimum. The decline mirrors the shrinking cash cushion and points to faster burn rather than a separate problem.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"db6df9ad-fb7b-4856-bca8-fa385b0f14e9\",\"explanation\":\"Revenue headroom is essentially flat, slipping only marginally to {{fact:9a38fdcd-b162-4b44-b97a-35e865451eb5}}. Revenue of {{fact:c277bd3c-74ac-4e79-b397-8c5931c3ba02}} of plan is comfortably above the {{fact:aa19c384-9083-4796-ab5b-79411e86381e}} threshold. Because sales are on track, the falling cash and runway look driven by spending or working capital rather than weaker revenue.\"}],\"ranking\":[\"130792d5-80b3-4ab3-9bda-c56dd80654f6\",\"a80b2b77-718c-475e-a555-d4797a10915d\",\"db6df9ad-fb7b-4856-bca8-fa385b0f14e9\"]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
